      Subordinate H.bar q φ' φ ∧ maxMult H.bar q φ' ≤ M ∧ MultCellsAmong H.bar q φ' M n := by
  intro E _ _ _ H q φ lab hDom hφ hφtw hlabtw hsl M n hM hmax hcells
